
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Triangle Drawer</title>
  <style>
    .triangle {
      width: 0;
      height: 0;
      border-style: solid;
      border-width: 0 100px 173px 100px;
      border-color: transparent transparent blue transparent;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="triangle"></div>
</body>
</html>

This code will draw a blue triangle using CSS borders. 😊
